\begin_layout Standard
Artificial intelligence was used throughout the project,
 for the code,
 for the explanation of concepts,
 for the circuits and for the drafting of text.
 This was my first experience of using it for development in Python.
 It was a powerful instrument,
 and it let me spend more time reading articles,
 following the quantum course and fixing bugs.
 It also showed that its output cannot be accepted without checking,
 because 
\emph on
it can contain errors that look convincing.

\emph default
 As described in Chapter 5
