\begin_layout Standard
A small game was enough to bring a complex subject within reach,
 and the same code,
 run on a simulator and on a real processor,
 showed both the beauty of entanglement and the imperfection of present machines.
 The work also showed that the new tools,
 from cloud quantum computers to AI assistants,
 are valuable when they are used with curiosity and with care.
 
\emph on
This is the main message that I wish to leave to the reader!
